2. Create the rule file `lib/{rule_file}.mjs` with names [{rule_id}, {rule_alias}], the description, tags [{tag}], and a function that reads {param} from config (applying the default) and reports via addErrorDetailIf / addError on the proper line with the required detail text. Make sure the default value never reports.
